// Automaton bastion: the precursor guardian at each of the outer reach's gates to the middle band (GDR-0026,
// GDR-0099 A7, GDR-0103). The Warden's build with a stronger heart: two cores (12 MW) run three cannons and two
// shield emitters there; each fist is the Warden's (two cannons and a thruster on one core). Shot apart, the fists
// fly on alone and the heart fights on until both its cores go dark or its cannons are gone. PLACEHOLDER layout
// (lead default, 18 Oct 2026). Not tagged `enemy`: the test range's waves keep to the rim's (GDR-0089).
(
    id: "automaton_bastion",
    name: "Automaton bastion",
    summary: "The outer reach's gate guardian: a twice-shielded heart with three cannons between two armed fists.",
    description: "Built like the [[ship:automaton_warden]], with more in the heart: two [[part:shield_emitter|shield emitters]] and three cannons on two [[part:automaton_core|cores]]. Break a bridge and that fist fights on alone; the heart holds until both its cores go dark or its cannons are shot off.",
    lore: "The precursors set their strongest guardians deepest in. This one has been waiting longer than the Warden.",
